"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-08-25T02:13:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T17:33:13Z","closed_at":"2026-08-27T17:33:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.7.2.stable.mono.official [ed1daf0bf] , v4.8.dev3.mono.official [51105ccbe] , and v4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe]\n- Not reproducible in v4.7.1.stable.mono.official [a13da4feb]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce MX250 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8183) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10510U CPU @ 1.80GHz (8 threads) - 15.72 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDragging via touch (not the mouse) causes the game or editor to freeze after a short time (currently in as low as 1 second, but I've seen it take 5-10 seconds as well). After releasing the drag, the game or editor will eventually become responsive again, after an amount of time that seems proportional to how long you kept dragging.\n\nI originally noticed this when trying to drag things around in my game, but I realized it can easily be reproduced in the editor itself.\n\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23a8282b-d035-4b51-b54a-e70814ac4715\" />\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In the editor, create or open a scene.\n2. In the scene tree, start dragging a node. After a few seconds the editor will freeze.\n3. Release the drag. After a short time the editor will be responsive again.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122791/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}